      "content": "that's a good start, super clear. but i think we can make it even better for the students. can you expand on this? maybe walk through the actual phases (prophase, metaphase, etc.) so they follow the sequence better.\n\nalso, looking at the initial draft, the \"pedagogical score\" was pretty low. it's fine, but since these guides are being ranked for the curriculum, any higher score helps the draft get approved faster. just try to weave those signposting words in more effectively as you explain the phases—but again, please don't make it sound weird or robotic. just make sure the student feels like they are being guided through the learning process.",
      "source": "evaluator"
